{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>\u00b7 Lost in the Silent World of Snow \u00b7</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/\u5c0f\u6807\u9898Intro.png?t=1748830521\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2727\u00a0Introduction\u00a0\u2727</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You advance across a vast, white snowfield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A thin ray of sunlight pierces through the gray cloud layer, and cold air fills your nostrils...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is nothing here, only endlessly falling snowflakes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----Is there really nothing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/\u5c0f\u6807\u9898Features.png?t=1748830521\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2727 Features\u00a0\u2727</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple and relaxing visuals and sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience different atmospheres from day to dusk to night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merge smaller snowflakes into larger ones, feeling an addictive satisfaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think about snowflake arrangement methods in progressively challenging levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet adorable animals and collect photos during your journey</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge for higher scores in infinite mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/\u5c0f\u6807\u9898Gameplay.png?t=1748830521\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2727\u00a0Gameplay\u00a0\u2727</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two adjacent snowflakes automatically merge into a larger snowflake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Water drops can be used to eliminate snowflakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create target snowflakes to complete levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725520/extras/snow.png?t=1748830521\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u2727 Departure \u2727","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725520/eae9dde07ae7387c350c0b21d67f8bee19d7bb5a.jpg"},{"name":"\u2727 Thin Frost \u2727","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725520/d0e7531dc2fcd7fd508d2492cd73ba37913147cd.jpg"},{"name":"\u2727 Misty Plains \u2727","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725520/8a922e0150826c9e848951370014f3a882d6197e.jpg"},{"name":"\u2727 Shattered Light \u2727","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725520/3732975a4c3cd1801ef44073bad31ceaa177420a.jpg"},{"name":"\u2727 Slanting Sun \u2727","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725520/5d9571d15b522e9730a1af9b0c014ff01e0949ea.jpg"},{"name":"\u2727 Evening Glow \u2727","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725520/98e2789e29a5f8498be75ef1d1fafb5342333fec.jpg"},{"name":"\u2727 Dusk \u2727","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725520/ad252c880e613173f95f81d008138351af427ee9.jpg"},{"name":"\u2727 Flowing Clouds \u2727","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725520/9615285706fcc3b6b8763a2d963d256315d7a6e7.jpg"},{"name":"\u2727 Setting Sun \u2727","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725520/13f4be6341d3464bfbe3f54e167c794ba78bbef0.jpg"},{"name":"\u2727 Fading Sun \u2727","path":"https://cdn.akama